Oracle workflow selection
├── given a provider proposal
│   ├── only the current factory owner can propose or replace it
│   ├── only the bound adapter's current owner can accept it
│   ├── an exact nonzero match is required
│   └── replacement, cancellation and consumption invalidate stale acceptance
├── when changing the workflow
│   ├── keep the proxy and implementation version
│   ├── retain NAV, nonce, snapshot and freeze
│   ├── discard the reviewed-report exception
│   ├── do not refresh an expired NAV
│   └── reject old-workflow reports and accept the new workflow's next epoch
└── given two curators and adapters using one implementation
    ├── each accepts a separately proposed workflow
    ├── neither curator can accept on the other's oracle
    ├── each oracle only accepts its own authenticated workflow reports
    └── changing one workflow leaves the other reporting normally
